  "21": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Kondensator o‘zgarmas EYuK manbaidan zaryadlanganda manba bajargan ish $qU=CU^2$, uning yarmi kondensator energiyasiga, yarmi issiqlikka aylanadi: $Q=\\frac{CU^2}{2}$. Batareya sig‘imi $C=20\\cdot4=80$ μF:"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "U=\\sqrt{\\frac{2Q}{C}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{2\\cdot10}{80\\cdot10^{-6}}}=\\sqrt{250\\,000}=500\\ \\text{V}"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**B)** 500"
     }
