      "text": "$D=6$ dptr, $F=\\frac16$ m, $\\Gamma=4$"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "$\\Gamma=\\frac{F}{|d-F|}$. Haqiqiy tasvir uchun $d_1>F$, mavhum tasvir uchun $d_2<F$:"
